{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;There's something oddly satisfying about tossing trash into a garbage can!&quot;</strong><br>This unique game lets you experience that everyday moment over and over again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Thrill of Tossing Trash:</strong> Press the Spacebar to adjust your throwing power, then release to aim for a perfect shot into the trash can.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sit Back and Watch:</strong> Simply watching the trash can might reveal things you\u2019ve never noticed before. Relax and enjoy the peaceful atmosphere of your room.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization Options:</strong> By unlocking a certain achievement, you\u2019ll be able to change the type of trash you throw or even move the trash can around.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spacebar:</strong> Adjust the throwing power; release to toss your trash.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Esc Key:</strong> Reset the tossed trash.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, after unlocking specific achievements and restarting the game, you\u2019ll discover new ways to interact. Try to find them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a <strong>simple yet surprisingly addictive</strong> experience. Enjoy the refreshing sensation of aiming your trash perfectly and the soothing world of gazing at the trash can at your own leisure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game allows (and welcomes) any form of gameplay recording, commentary, or live streaming, including its hidden elements.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"10 throws","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3441140/489afadae0085db45882cab4ab20bb61bd0fcd98.jpg"},{"